  {
   "type": "text",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Cell permeability is a key bottleneck for PROTAC development, and public data available to model it is scarce and inconsistent."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The largest public resource, PROTAC-DB 3.0 [3], contains just 31 PROTACs with PAMPA measurements."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "That workflow targets the pharmacodynamic axis of degradation, however, and doesn’t cover ADME properties."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "page": 3,
   "text": "Alpha is set to 1.0 for all models."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "page": 4,
   "text": "We believe a model trained on PROTAC-DB data does not generalize to the newly-extracted data because PROTAC-DB spans a narrow region of degrader chemistry that the extracted set includes."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "page": 6,
   "text": "Predictive models for new modalities depend on high-quality published data, and for PROTAC permeability we are not there yet."
  },
